  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Under the Avatars settings menu, there is a similar option for culling out expensive avatars called \"Max Avatar Download Size\".\n\nWith recent implementation of texture memory being accounted for in avatar performance, it would be nice to manually cull out avatars with an overwhelming texture memory.\n\nAn example of this would be: I would like to show Very Poor avatars for everyone, but I would like to only see the ones that have a moderate amount of texture memory and isn't going to overwhelm my VRAM.",
